hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20318","Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Tufawi narrated to us, Said al-Jurayri narrated to us from a man of Banu Tamim, and he praised him well, from his father or his uncle, he said: I prayed behind the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and we asked him about the measure of his bowing and prostration. He said: The measure of a man saying: Glory be to Allah and with His praise, three times."
